  "bodyHash": "e0ba6d551503791a",
  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/header/header.png\" alt=\"一个 Serilum 模组。用心打造。为 Fabric、Forge 和 Neo 提供大量活跃模组！\" width=\"838\" height=\"400\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/serilum/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/curseforge.svg\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fSerilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/modrinth.svg\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/patreon.svg\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/youtube.svg\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"200\"></a></p>\n<h2><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/about-the-mod.svg\" alt=\"关于模组\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">《Pumpkillager 的任务》是 SpookyJam 2022 的参赛作品。它添加了一条包含多次遭遇战、自定义行为、（外观）奖励以及高难度 Boss 战的剧情任务线。本描述将包含剧透，但仅出现在 <strong>&lt;剧透警告&gt;</strong> 标题之后。</span></p>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\">\n<p><img style=\"display:inline-block\" src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/pumpkillagers-quest/d.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;display:inline-block\"><strong><span style=\"color:#f90;font-size:14px;display:inline-block\">Pumpkillager</span></strong></span></p>\n</div>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">该模组不添加新资源文件。相反，内容通过现有的原版资源功能实现。自定义玩家头颅贴图可生成新方块，自定义渲染器会改变实体大小，事件回调则用于增加游戏特性。这也意味着如果你愿意，可以在完成冒险后移除该模组，你依然可以保留并使用所有已获得的奖励。<br><br>在收获南瓜方块时有 1/10 的概率遭遇 Pumpkillager。南瓜方块必须在东西南北四个方向及上方周围均为空气，才能触发。这是为了防止他在不该出现的地方（例如自定义的南瓜建筑内）生成。模组还添加了猪生成时有一定概率伴随生成南瓜的机制，这会在世界中额外散布一些南瓜，从而自然增加遇到 Pumpkillager 的几率。<br><br>从 Pumpkillager 处接取任务书即可开始冒险。通过多方块仪式和对话推进流程。Boss 战需要充分准备，请穿上最好的盔甲并手持盾牌！可能还需要一些药水。别担心，战斗时机到来时你自然会知道。<br><br>最重要的是，沉浸其中，玩得开心！ :)</span></p>\n<h2><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/dependencies.svg\" alt=\"依赖项\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/collective\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/requires/collective.svg\" alt=\"需要 Collective\" width=\"251\" height=\"49\"></a><br><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/the-vanilla-experience\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/the-vanilla-experience.svg\" alt=\"包含于 The Vanilla Experience\" width=\"350\" height=\"49\"></a><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/serilums-rpg-bundle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/rpg-bundle.svg\" alt=\"包含于 Serilum 的 RPG 合集\" width=\"334\" height=\"49\"></a><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/environment/both.svg\" alt=\"环境：客户端与服务器\" width=\"293\" height=\"49\"></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/configurable.svg\" alt=\"可配置项\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252fconfiguration-guide\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/configuration-guide.svg\" alt=\"配置指南\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px\">所有可用配置选项：</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\" style=\"margin-left:10px;padding-left:10px\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>spumpkillagerSpawnChance</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 0.1，最小值 0.001，最大值 1.0</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">玩家破坏南瓜方块时 Pumpkillager 的生成概率。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>enablePumpkillagerSpawnDuringCreative</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 false</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">玩家在创造模式下破坏南瓜时是否允许 Pumpkillager 生成。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>finalBossMaxHealth</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 300.0，最小值 1.0，最大值 10000.0</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">最终 Boss 的生命值数量。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>experienceAmountRewardFinalBoss</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 250，最小值 0，最大值 10000</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">最终 Boss 死亡时应掉落的经验值数量。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>chanceForPumpkinBlockToSpawnOnPigSpawn</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 0.05，最小值 0，最大值 1.0</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">此功能旨在向世界添加更多南瓜，使玩家更自然地遇到 Pumpkillager。每当一只猪生成时，它有一定概率直接生成在南瓜方块上。这会让南瓜散布在世界各处。如需关闭此功能，请将配置中的概率值设为 0。</span></p>\n</div>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/commands.svg\" alt=\"命令\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">/pumpkillager reset &lt;玩家&gt; - <em>重置目标玩家的 Pumpkillager 冒险进度。</em></span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">/pumpkillager book &lt;书&gt; - <em>手动生成任务书道具。</em></span></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/showcase.svg\" alt=\"展示\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>（第一？）本任务书：</strong></span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/pumpkillagers-quest/b.jpg\" alt=\"\"><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>Pumpkillager：</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/pumpkillagers-quest/a.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;<br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>包含协助你完成仪式的功能：</strong></span></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/pumpkillagers-quest/c.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"492\"></p>\n</div>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/description.svg\" alt=\"说明\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;font-size:18px\"><br><br><span style=\"font-size:32px;text-align:center\"><strong>! &lt;剧透警告&gt; !<br><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:18px\">Pumpkillager 的任务指南</span></strong><br></span></p>\n<p><br><br><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">1. </span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">首次遭遇 Pumpkillager。破坏四周没有方块的南瓜后有随机几率使其出现。你将获得一本任务书。</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/pumpkillagers-quest/guide/1.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><br><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">2. </span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">阅读收到的任务书将向你展示如何完成第一个仪式。你可以右键点击地面预览其搭建方式。</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/pumpkillagers-quest/guide/2.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><br><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">3. </span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">完成第一个仪式后，你会再次遇到 Pumpkillager。在他离开前，他会掉落一张写有囚犯营地坐标的纸条。</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/pumpkillagers-quest/guide/3.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><br><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">4. </span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">到达坐标后，你会看到悬浮在半空的囚犯营地。你可以使用任意喜欢的方式进入。营地旁边还有三股水流方便你攀登。</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/pumpkillagers-quest/guide/4.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><br><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">5. </span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">进入囚犯营地。小心守卫。</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/pumpkillagers-quest/guide/5.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><br><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">6. </span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">你可以击杀守卫，他们死亡时会掉落头颅。</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/pumpkillagers-quest/guide/6.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><br><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">7. </span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">与树内的囚犯对话。他会告诉你他的真名。对话结束后，你将获得一本新书、一张弓和若干箭矢。</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/pumpkillagers-quest/guide/7.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><br><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">8. </span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">在岛屿周围寻找装饰头颅和蜡烛。完成下一个仪式需要用到蜡烛。</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/pumpkillagers-quest/guide/8.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><br><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">9. </span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Jax o' Saturn 给你的书中包含了另一个仪式的说明。你可以再次右键地面查看搭建方法。</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/pumpkillagers-quest/guide/9.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><br><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">10. </span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">做好战斗准备！布置好仪式，确保环境黑暗，然后放置最后一个南瓜或点燃最后一根蜡烛。Pumpkillager 将再次出现。射出幽灵箭以削弱他。他将分阶段召唤怪物波次：开局、75%血量、50%血量和25%血量时各触发一次。</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/pumpkillagers-quest/guide/10.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><br><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">11. </span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">击败他并收获奖励吧！恭喜你，拯救了世界。</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/pumpkillagers-quest/guide/11.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/notes-n-links.svg\" alt=\"备注与链接\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>只要下载源仍托管于 CurseForge 或 Modrinth 生态内，你就可以在任何整合包中自由使用该模组。</strong></span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px;color:#008000\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Serilum.com</a> 提供了所有可用模组的概览及更多信息。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">由于我无法在多个独立的模组页面上统一追踪评论，因此已关闭评论功能。</span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br>如遇问题、拥有想法、建议或任何其他需求，请访问&nbsp;<a style=\"font-size:14px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://github.com/Serilum/.issue-tracker\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub 仓库</a>。谢谢！</span><span style=\"font-size:6px\"><br><br></span></p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
